  "assets/pdf/portrait.pdf"

.\" ================================ PROFILE =============================
.PROFILE_BEGIN
Software engineer with 7+ years of professional experience delivering web products, complemented
by independent systems engineering in C. Experienced in React, TypeScript, software architecture
and reusable component systems. Creator of a dependency-light Pure-C stack spanning HTTP
services, WebAssembly, in-memory databases, search and graphics.
.PROFILE_END

.\" ================================= BODY ==============================
.TS
tab(@);
lw(243p)2 lw(243p).
T{
.SECTION EXPERIENCE
.ROLE "11/2025 – 08/2026" "Front-end and Architecture Specialist" "Loomtech" "Lisbon"
Built a component-block document editor \(em layout and editor engines \(em with PDF and DOCX export, and architected the data model and frontend architecture. Automated component reuse across four entity types, and built forms, tables and infinite-scroll lists from minimal custom code.
.ROLE "11/2022 – 02/2025" "Front-end Developer" "Mov.ai" "Lisbon"
Primary frontend developer for a robotics solution. Added real-time logs and dynamic tables, refactored legacy code into encapsulated abstractions, and upgraded React and Material-UI.
.ROLE "12/2021 – 07/2022" "Front-end Developer / Tech Lead" "PrimeIT" "Lisbon"
Built micro-frontends for a GDPR compliance screen and proposed data-model and structural improvements, extracting reusable generalisations.
.ROLE "10/2020 – 11/2021" "Full-stack Developer" "UNPARALLEL" "Lisbon"
Built WordPress plugins, a Next.js full-stack app, a C++ Arduino library and assorted JavaScript projects, and contributed to the main React project.
.ROLE "11/2019 – 05/2020" "Full-stack Developer" "Mobinteg" "Lisbon"
Delivered multiple full-stack solutions and handled Unix administration and basic DevOps. Wrote a launcher to run the same application on either Angular or Mithril, and started using vim.css.
.ROLE "08/2017 – 08/2018" "Web Developer" "Exictos" "Funchal"
Maintained a portal for bank employees, wrote a C tool to remove duplicate labels, and built a mobile version of the employee portal.
T}@T{
.COLUMN_START
.ROLE "06/2016 – 09/2016" "Software Developer (Internship)" "MIT-I" "Funchal"
Built tools to identify visually similar images, using SIFT and custom filtering strategies.
.ROLE "08/2014 – 05/2015" "Web Developer (Internship)" "CEHA" "Funchal"
Built full-text search over book contents, cutting search times from weeks to under 0.14 seconds, and a rudimentary bundler for modern JavaScript syntax, along the lines of Webpack and Babel.
